of the waves, which have been considered to be normally incident to the structure. Finally, no wave
transformation models has been adopted. This simplificative hypothesis is expected to result in a
strongly conservative approach. The nodes IncidentSignificantHeight and IncidentPeakPeriod are
computed according to Eq.(8) and Eq.(9).
