It can be deduced that combination 1 would give as a result the maximum value of P(F1) if
and only if both the conditions p(F1|S1) > p(F1|S2) and p(F1|A1) > p(F1|A2) are veried.
Hence the combination of bounds in input which results in the computation of P(F1) =
