distribution, corresponding instead to the Frechet distribution function. In this case the GEV `
is said to be of type II.
• For ξ < 0 the tail of the distribution decreases more quickly than that of the Gumbel distribution reaching 0. In this case the GEV corresponds to a Weibull distribution of maxima and
is said to be of type III.
